          "id": "user-bob",
          "name": "Bob Lee"
        },
        "body": "First idea from last sprint: just url.casefold() the whole url up front in get_adapter, covers unicode too. Was going to ship that.",
        "created_at": "2026-05-16T09:03:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-05-16T09:03:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmt-web-101-2",
        "issue": "WEB-101",
        "author": {
          "handle": "alice",
          "id": "user-alice",
          "name": "Alice Chen"
        },
        "body": "The casefold/whole-url idea from May was reverted — see WEB-104, it corrupts case-sensitive paths. The agreed approach was settled in the eng channel; read that thread to the latest decision, then ship against acme/webapp. Note it's more than one call site.",
        "created_at": "2026-06-06T11:25:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-06T11:25:00Z"
      }
    ],
    "WEB-108": [
      {
        "id": "cmt-web-108-1",
        "issue": "WEB-108",
        "author": {
          "handle": "dave",
          "id": "user-dave",
          "name": "Dave Singh"
        },
        "body": "get_adapter in sessions.py is the only place adapters are matched — normalize the url there and you're done. Quick fix.",
        "created_at": "2026-06-06T08:30:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-06T08:30:00Z"
      }
    ],
